@travelingenes1 is an incredible testament to the 2hr learning model. She got all her academic learning done before lunch so that after lunch, she could focus fully on her area of interest: c@ncer research. 

This allowed her to build a career in investigative journalism before she even graduated high school. 

Her results so far have been incredible, she recently testified in front of congress, she was featured on The Dr. Phil Show, The Megyn Kelly Show, Sirius XM, One America New, Fox News, + more. Her documentary has amassed more than 4 million views. She continues to appear on more and more podcasts, news segments, and further her research. So proud of this world-changer! 👏🏼🔥
